                "schemeImageUrl": "",
                "briefDescription": "The scheme aims to motivate the growers to bring more area under irrigation by constructing water storage structures, rain water harvesting structures and installation of irrigation equipments for increasing the productivity and improving quality of large cardamom.",
                "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme “Large Cardamom Irrigation Land Development: Irrigation Equipment (Nos)” is a component of the Integrated Scheme for Export Promotion and Quality Improvement in Spices and Research and Development of Cardamom implemented during the 15th Finance Commission period (2021–22 to 2025–26) under the Export-Oriented Production component. The scheme aims to motivate growers to bring more area under irrigation by supporting the construction of water storage structures, rainwater harvesting systems, and the installation of irrigation equipment, thereby increasing productivity and improving the quality of large cardamom.\n<br>\n\n",
                "benefits_md": "\n1. 50 % of cost of equipment subject to a maximum of ₹ 15,000 for General and 75% subject to maximum of ₹  20,000/- for SC/ST\n1. Large cardamom growers having land holding size of 0.10 Ha to 8 Ha\n\n<br>\n\n",
                "exclusions_md": "<br>\n\n",
                "detailedDescription": [
                    {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "text": "The scheme “Large Cardamom Irrigation Land Development: Irrigation Equipment (Nos)” is a component of the Integrated Scheme for Export Promotion and Quality Improvement in Spices and Research and Development of Cardamom implemented during the 15th Finance Commission period (2021–22 to 2025–26) under the Export-Oriented Production component. The scheme aims to motivate growers to bring more area under irrigation by supporting the construction of water storage structures, rainwater harvesting systems, and the installation of irrigation equipment, thereby increasing productivity and improving the quality of large cardamom."
